5406
07:43:43,696 --> 07:43:44,016
B.
B.

5407
07:43:44,590 --> 07:43:47,776
按修改时间排序读取文件，最新的在前。
Read files in modification time order, newest first.

5408
07:43:58,542 --> 07:43:59,684
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

5409
07:44:00,174 --> 07:44:05,668
在小包上表现良好但在大包上变差，这说明读取的文件数量是变量。
Good on small packages and worse on large ones tells you the number of files read is the variable.

5410
07:44:06,830 --> 07:44:08,868
该策略的扩展性与错误的对象相关联。
The strategy scales with the wrong thing.

5411
07:44:09,646 --> 07:44:12,068
选项 A 是一个反复出现的陷阱。
Option A is the recurring trap.

5412
